OL,3,GNEWSAWhy council is funding patrols
OL,4,Anear asylum base
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniformed security patrols have taken
OL,7,Fto the streets of three towns in Essex
OL,8,Fwhich are frequently visited by asylum
OL,9,Fseekers housed on a former military
OL,10,Fbase.
OL,12,FReform UK-led Essex County Council said
OL,13,FOperation Vanguard was being trialled
OL,14,Ffor three months in direct response to
OL,15,Fconcerns raised by residents and would
OL,16,F"deter anti-social behaviour".
OL,18,FPolice say crimes linked to the MDP
OL,19,FWethersfield site are very low.
OL,21,FHere's what you need to know about the
OL,22,Fscheme:
